        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: பணிநீக்கம்",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பணிநீக்கம் — paṇinīkkam — \"dismissal; the sack\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நிறுவனம் நஷ்டம் அடைந்ததால் பலர் பணிநீக்கம் செய்யப்பட்டார்கள். niṟuvaṉam naṣṭam aṭaintatāl palar paṇinīkkam ceyyappaṭṭārkaḷ. Because the company made a loss, many people were dismissed."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பணி \"work, service\" + நீக்கம் \"removal\". With செய் it is a verb: பணிநீக்கம் (paṇinīkkam) செய், to dismiss."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பணிநீக்கம் (paṇinīkkam) is a native compound: பணி (paṇi), \"work, service\" (DEDR 3884), and நீக்கம் (nīkkam), \"removal\", from நீக்கு, \"to remove\" (DEDR 3685)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
